  74:       // GitHub handle above, they are things the person states about themselves at the moment of
  75:       // acknowledging, and no fact Auth holds could supply them. What keeps them honest is the
  76:       // shared module: it refuses a missing or blank one, and it refuses an attestation that is not
  77:       // the shipped authority statement, so a client cannot assert an authority nobody offered.
  78:       signerName: body.value.signerName,
