 202: language plpgsql
 203: -- SECURITY DEFINER for the measured reason the first migration states at length: `service_role`
 204: -- holds no INSERT on any table in this schema, so an invoker function would fail on its first write,
 205: -- and granting it INSERT instead would open a direct write path around the refusals below. That
 206: -- reasoning is unchanged and applies to `public.volunteer_profiles` exactly as it does to the other
 207: -- four tables — the service role has no INSERT there either.
