 256:   if v_account_type = 'volunteer' then
 257:     -- (a) the link itself. This is the database's own statement of AT-001.04, and it is not the
 258:     -- user-facing one: `validateCompleteSignup` in `supabase/functions/_shared/accounts.ts` refuses
 259:     -- the same completion first, with the sentence a person reads. This one exists for the caller
 260:     -- that never went through the edge function at all.
 261:     -- `v_github_handle` is the WHITESPACE-TRIMMED value (see the declare block), so a handle of
