 270:     -- (b) THE BACKSTOP, AND IT BINDS THE HANDLE RATHER THAN MERELY ASKING WHETHER ONE EXISTS.
 271:     --
 272:     -- Checking only that SOME GitHub identity is linked would answer a different question from the
 273:     -- one the row records. The row records A SPECIFIC HANDLE, so an existence-only check leaves
