 498: /**
 499:  * AT-001.13 — the session refreshes AUTOMATICALLY, with no forced re-login mid-work.
 500:  *
 501:  * GATE 1'S FINDING 7 IS WHY THIS BODY LOOKS DIFFERENT FROM EVERY OTHER ONE HERE. The criterion's
 502:  * word is "automatically", and every existing piece of evidence proves the MECHANISM: the loop body
 503:  * calls `refreshSession` explicitly, and the live proof transcript says in its own words that it
 504:  * establishes nothing about scheduling. A mechanism-only green at the tier whose meaning is "proved
